.TH ANNOTATION.TERMS 2 2000-1月 "write_simple_vfdb" "write_simple_vfdb"
.SH NAME
write_simple_vfdb \- save the VFDB virulence factor sequence data as a simple fasta format
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIwrite_simple_vfdb(\fBvfdb\fR as <generic> VFs[], 
\fBfile\fR as string);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
save the VFDB virulence factor sequence data as a simple fasta format 
 sequence file
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBvfdb\fB \fR\- 
 a vector of the [VFs](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.Metagenome.MetaFunction.VFDB.VFs) virulence factor object for save as 
 the fasta sequence file.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBfile\fB \fR\- 
 the file path of the generated fasta sequence file.
. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a boolean value of the file save result: TRUE means the virulence 
 factor sequence data has been written into the target file 
 successfully.
.PP
